Rule 1 (input tensor dtype must be supported by TensorFlow square: int32, int64, float16/32/64, complex64/128)
{v_1 : tensor} |= dtype_(v_1) = 3 ∨ dtype_(v_1) = 4 ∨ dtype_(v_1) = 6 ∨ dtype_(v_1) = 7 ∨ dtype_(v_1) = 8 ∨ dtype_(v_1) = 9 ∨ dtype_(v_1) = 10
>>
Rule 2 (tensor rank should be reasonably small)
{v_1 : tensor} |= ndim(v_1) ≤ 8
>>
Rule 3 (if not a scalar, all dimensions must be strictly positive)
{v_1 : tensor} |= if ndim(v_1) ≠ 0 then ∀i ∈ [0, ndim(v_1) - 1] : shape(v_1, i) > 0
>>
Rule 4 (for real-valued tensors that are scalar or non-empty, min ≤ max)
{v_1 : tensor} |= if ((dtype_(v_1) = 3 ∨ dtype_(v_1) = 4 ∨ dtype_(v_1) = 6 ∨ dtype_(v_1) = 7 ∨ dtype_(v_1) = 8) ∧ (ndim(v_1) = 0 ∨ ∀i ∈ [0, ndim(v_1) - 1] : shape(v_1, i) > 0)) then min(v_1) ≤ max(v_1)
